                                "sense_id": "0e3d8006-3486-3699-9622-b769ff852d13",
                                "text": "The United Nations refugee agency (UNHCR) warned there was a risk some migrants sent to Rwanda could be returned to countries from which they had fled. Kigali denied the allegations and accused UNHCR of lying."
